graph TD
  subgraph Ingestion[Ingestion]
    A[Source DB and document storage] -->|Read only, checkpointed import| B[Connector and ingestion queue]
    B --> C[File validation and safe conversion]
    C -->|Originals, hashes and page references| D[Private evidence storage]
    C --> E[Native text extraction and OCR]
    E --> F[Field extraction and evidence mapping]
    F --> G[Validation, identity and duplicate checks]
    G --> H[Human review and approval]
  end
  subgraph Registry[Consent registry]
    H -->|Approved evidence and scoped records| I[Consent API and policy rules]
    I --> J[(db-consent: records, history, outbox)]
    D -.->|Restricted evidence access| H
  end
  subgraph Use[Portal and enforcement]
    K[Identity provider and verified account link] --> L[PMP portal]
    L -->|View and withdraw by purpose| I
    J --> M[Outbox delivery worker]
    M -->|Versioned events, retries, acknowledgments| N[Downstream purpose enforcement]
  end
  O[Access control, audit and monitoring] -.-> B
  O -.-> I
  O -.-> M
